{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>The deeps.</b> The deeps of the earth, like “the earth shall swallow them” (Numbers 16:30)." "And יְכַסְיֻמוּ has a cholam where there would be a shureq, like לא תעבורי מזה (Ruth 2:8)." "<b>Into the depths.</b> The deep waters, and likewise “You cast me into the depths” (Jonah 2:4), in the depths of the waves."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {1 "The heading 'ושורק' literally means 'and a shureq'; the comment addresses the absence of the expected shureq vowel in the form יְכַסְיֻמוּ and cites לא תעבורי מזה as a parallel case of a form without shureq."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:42.117425596Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}